!!
!! SA-AMG (PRECOND=22) test : a level that forms no aggregate, on the NDOF=1 heat model of S341
!! SA_CoarseSize=1 (int slot7) keeps coarsening down to a few nodes, where SA_Theta=0.3 (real slot1) leaves
!! no strong coupling and no aggregate; that level must be the coarsest instead of making an empty next level
!! coarsest solver forced to distributed sparse MUMPS (coarse_solver=3 (slot1))
!!
!SOLUTION,TYPE=HEAT
!HEAT
,,,,100
!FIXTEMP
 XMIN, 0.0
!DFLUX
 HGEN, BF, 2500.0
!SOLVER,METHOD=1,PRECOND=22,ITERLOG=NO,TIMELOG=NO,LOGLEVEL=1
 20000, 1, 10, 10
 1.0e-8, 1.0, 0.0
 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 4
 0.3, 0, 0, 1000000, 0, 1
!WRITE,RESULT
!END
